      "writtenOn": "2024-01-16T08:32:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As the digest is the outcome of the hash function rather than its parameters, it should be the responsibility of the callers to verify the digests. It\u0027s difficult to check it here since we don\u0027t know it should be change or not.\n\nFor example, in the case of `initrd`/`rialto`, the digests should change, whereas for `microdrod_kernel`, they should remain the same. Although I haven\u0027t included these checks in this function, I did verify the digests before and after resigning rialto. For other cases, we need to assess them individually to determine if which kind of digest check should be added.",
      "parentUuid": "f662b230_646ca312",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 253,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 253,
        "endChar": 93
      },
      "revId": "34c1923f4ffe2f89e055b3f6433d522c43f1f878",
