      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can\u0027t we use the function `check_resigned_image_avb_info` above for checking rialto?\nIIUC, assertions below are replacable. Also, it could reduce hard-coded values in assertions.\n\n\n- `len(updated_descriptors)`\n- `len(updated_prop)`\n- `updated_info[\"Rollback Index\"]`\n- `len(updated_hash_descriptors)`\n- `assert_different_value(original_descriptor, updated_descriptor, \"Digest\", rialto_hash_descriptor\")`",
      "range": {
